<codeline lineno="24"><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="25"><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>get<sp/>the<sp/>test<sp/>patch<sp/>from<sp/>the<sp/>image<sp/>and<sp/>compute<sp/>its<sp/>zero<sp/>mean<sp/>self.</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="26"><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Eigen::Matrix&lt;QDVO::ImageIntensityType,<sp/>PATCH_WIDTH,<sp/>PATCH_WIDTH&gt;<sp/>patchData<sp/>=<sp/>targetImage.block&lt;PATCH_WIDTH,<sp/>PATCH_WIDTH&gt;(tl(1),<sp/>tl(0));</highlight></codeline>
